# PROPOSED BENCH CONFIGURATION. Not applied automatically.
# Read docs/cube-external-nav.md before importing. Requires stable live VIO,
# a measured mounting/alignment, and a configured EKF origin if GPS supplies none.
# Source set 1 is deliberately omitted; preserve its existing GPS/optical-flow setup.
# Source set 2 currently uses optical-flow velocity: this proposal replaces that
# secondary set with external horizontal position and no velocity fusion.
VISO_TYPE 3
VISO_ORIENT 0
VISO_POS_X 0.15
VISO_POS_Y 0.0
VISO_POS_Z 0.0
VISO_QUAL_MIN 40
EK3_SRC2_POSXY 6
EK3_SRC2_VELXY 0
EK3_SRC2_POSZ 1
EK3_SRC2_VELZ 0
EK3_SRC2_YAW 1
